<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>After you receive,</l><l>Are filled and enriched</l><l>By such a supply,</l><l>Go! Open your mouth!</l><l>Speak to all men the words of this life!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>And having the same</l><l>Spirit of faith,</l><l>Be strong! Be not weak!</l><l>“We also believe,</l><l>Therefore we also must speak!”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
